# Generated OpenAPI contract artifacts. `contracts/openapi.json` and
# `apps/api/contract/openapi.json` are ~750 KB machine-written JSON;
# `apps/web/src/generated/api-schema.ts` is a ~19k-line generated TypeScript
# file. `linguist-generated` keeps them out of language statistics and
# collapses them by default in GitHub diffs, and `-diff` stops git from
# producing a textual diff no one reads. They are regenerated by
# ./scripts/regen-contracts.sh and never hand-edited; review the schema
# change that produced them instead.
contracts/openapi.json linguist-generated=true -diff
apps/api/contract/openapi.json linguist-generated=true -diff
apps/web/src/generated/api-schema.ts linguist-generated=true -diff
